  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A magnet attached to a spring oscillates above a coil as shown. The period of the oscillation is T.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The graph shows the variation with time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> of the current <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span> in the coil.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The amplitude of the magnet’s oscillation is now decreased.</p>\n<p>What is the new variation of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span> with <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>?<br/><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure></p>\n<p>[1]</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Option A is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"B\">Option B is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"C\">Option C is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"D\">Option D is shown in the figure above.</li></ol>"
